msgid "Sign up with your email. You check every entry before it's saved."
msgstr "Mag-sign up gamit ang iyong email. I-check ang bawat entry bago ito i-save."

msgid "Write it the way you talk"
msgstr "Isulat ito sa paraang pananalita mo"

msgid "One message can hold several entries — spending, income, transfers between your accounts, even budgets. The AI reads it; you check the preview and save."
msgstr "Ang isang mensahe ay maaaring maglaman ng ilang entry — paggastos, kita, paglilipat sa pagitan ng iyong mga account, kahit na mga badyet. Binabasa ito ng AI; i-check mo ang preview at i-save."

msgid "How it works"
msgstr "Paano ito gumagana"

msgid "Type or say it"
msgstr "I-type o sabihin ito"

msgid "Write or speak what happened, in English, বাংলা or Banglish. Several things in one message is fine."
